the knowledge base r3_6_subsidiarity includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/subsidiarity.ruml".

% Der Auffangtatbestand greift nur, wenn der vorrangige Tatbestand nicht greift
Auffangtatbestand greift holds for a case if
    Auffangtatbestand greift is decided for the case
    and it is not the case that Vorrangiger Tatbestand holds for the case
    and Auffangtatbestand holds for the case.

Auffangtatbestand greift holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Auffangtatbestand greift is decided for the case
    and Auffangtatbestand greift would hold for the case.

Auffangtatbestand greift is decided for a case if
    Vorrangiger Tatbestand is decided for the case
    and Auffangtatbestand is decided for the case.

Vorrangiger Tatbestand holds for a case if
    the answer to Vorrangiger Tatbestand for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Vorrangiger Tatbestand holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Vorrangiger Tatbestand for the case is a truth value
    and Vorrangiger Tatbestand would hold for the case.

Vorrangiger Tatbestand is decided for a case if
    the answer to Vorrangiger Tatbestand for the case is a truth value.

Auffangtatbestand holds for a case if
    the answer to Auffangtatbestand for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Auffangtatbestand holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Auffangtatbestand for the case is a truth value
    and Auffangtatbestand would hold for the case.

Auffangtatbestand is decided for a case if
    the answer to Auffangtatbestand for the case is a truth value.

